    "Closing a VM without properly shutting it down could result in data loss." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Om 'n VM toe te maak sonder om dit behoorlik af te skakel, kan dataverlies tot gevolg hê."
